cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Botwiner research: short-horizon Pump launch strategy evaluation"
message: "If this research or code is useful, please cite the repository and the negative-result report."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dallo
    given-names: Obada
repository-code: "https://github.com/obadadallo95/botwiner"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research pipeline for collecting and replaying Pump bonding-curve
  events, measuring feed quality, and evaluating whether ultra-short-horizon entry
  and exit rules retain a profit edge after latency, costs, slippage, and exit
  uncertainty. The reported capital-aware sweep is a negative result: no tested
  configuration was production-ready under conservative execution assumptions.
keywords:
  - Solana
  - Pump.fun
  - market-data research
  - reproducibility
  - negative result
license: MIT
